      "message": "Consider making at least these two longtest builders mandatory, which can be done with the `Cq-Include-Trybots` footer:\n\n```suggestion\nChange-Id: I3fac703ec70559e18b30d5fff88274335a7c3952\nCq-Include-Trybots: x_crypto-gotip-linux-amd64-longtest,x_crypto-go1.24-linux-amd64-longtest\n```\n\nThat will make them run whenever Commit-Queue+1 is triggered, without needing to manually trigger them. See https://go.dev/wiki/SlowBots#using-slowbots for details.\n\nNote that the \"x_crypto-\" prefix in the builder means to run tests in the x/crypto repo. Leaving that out results in just the main Go repo tests running.",
